sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dictaphone@{ "type": "control" } as Dictaphone backend worker
    participant API@{ "type": "boundary" } as Summary FastAPI
    participant Queue@{ "type": "queue" } as Summary Celery/Redis
    participant Worker@{ "type": "control" } as Summary Celery worker
    participant Store@{ "type": "database" } as S3/MinIO temporary result store
    participant Docs@{ "type": "boundary" } as La Suite Docs
    participant WebhookQueue@{ "type": "queue" } as Webhook task queue
    participant Webhook@{ "type": "boundary" } as Dictaphone webhook endpoint

    Dictaphone->>API: POST /api/v2/async-jobs/summarize<br/>tenant Bearer key + transcript content
    API->>API: Verify tenant API key and validate request
    API->>Queue: summarize_v2_task.apply_async<br/>queue: summarize-queue-v2
    API-->>Dictaphone: 200 pending + job id
    Queue->>Worker: summarize_v2_task(job_id)

    alt Summary generation failure
        Worker->>WebhookQueue: call_webhook_v2_task(failure)<br/>queue: call-webhook-queue-v2
        WebhookQueue->>Webhook: POST failure webhook
        Webhook-->>Dictaphone: Failure callback
    else Summary generation succeeds
        Worker->>Worker: Generate summary result
        Worker->>Store: Store summary as summaries/{job_id}.txt
        Store-->>Worker: Stored
        opt Push-to-Docs requested and tenant allowed
            Worker->>Docs: Create document for owner
            Docs-->>Worker: 201 document created
        end
        Worker->>Store: Create signed GET URL for summary
        Worker->>WebhookQueue: call_webhook_v2_task(success)<br/>queue: call-webhook-queue-v2
        WebhookQueue->>Webhook: POST success webhook + summary_data_url
        Webhook-->>Dictaphone: 2xx success callback
        Dictaphone->>Dictaphone: Download result, store locally, mark job SUCCESS
    end

    Note over Worker,Webhook: Summary construction is intentionally represented as one opaque worker step.


